  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Flash Enchantment Spell. All nearby foes are set on fire for 1...3...3 second[s]. For 20 seconds afterward, this enchantment does nothing. When this enchantment ends, you gain 1...2...2 strike[s] of adrenaline if any foes are within earshot.",
      "zhTW": "使附近敵人著火 1～3 秒。接下來的 20 秒，此加持並沒有直接效果。此加持結束時，若是音量所及範圍內有任何敵人，你獲得等同 1～2 次攻擊的怒氣值。"
    },
